But it'd be boring if everything went smoothly

349
00:25:06,510 --> 00:25:09,050
If I could hop in a time machine

350
00:25:09,050 --> 00:25:11,050
And become a traveler

351
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:38,810
Lyrics, composition, arrangement: Hatsune Miku

352
00:25:57,590 --> 00:26:02,890
Yo, kick open the door and burst out into the streets, trendsetter

353
00:26:02,890 --> 00:26:07,570
Violence, booze, women, music — wearing the mask of an adult

354
00:26:07,570 --> 00:26:12,310
Come on, let's dance — today's the day, the crew's in a rush

355
00:26:12,310 --> 00:26:16,970
Not enough? Little rider — the streets are swirling with desire

356
00:26:16,970 --> 00:26:21,770
It's always been like that — the old legends were our textbook

357
00:26:21,770 --> 00:26:26,470
Kept up appearances till we dropped — swore it, that day after school

358
00:26:26,470 --> 00:26:31,110
We're Peter Pans — can't be saying "maybe someday"

359
00:26:31,110 --> 00:26:35,730
Tell those laughing adults — you only get one life

360
00:26:35,730 --> 00:26:40,490
Oh, the fantasies in my chest, high-speed impulse

361
00:26:40,490 --> 00:26:45,490
Oh, turning a blind eye — no, no

362
00:26:45,490 --> 00:26:49,490
Chasing dreams, laughed at, battered and gleaming — my way

363
00:26:49,490 --> 00:26:52,870
Go on, you should know who we are

364
00:26:52,870 --> 00:26:57,530
Forever young, hey! Just listen to me from now

365
00:26:57,530 --> 00:27:02,230
What matters most is the state of your soul

366
00:27:02,230 --> 00:27:03,950
Forever young

367
00:27:03,950 --> 00:27:06,930
Hey! It's your turn to fly from here

368
00:27:06,930 --> 00:27:09,450
I wish I'd started back then

369
00:27:09,450 --> 00:27:13,690
The next time to begin is now

370
00:27:13,690 --> 00:27:15,770
The city's noise laughing down at you

371
00:27:15,770 --> 00:27:18,110
If you're just playing to the crowd, no one will turn around

372
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:19,730
How many times? Forget it

373
00:27:19,730 --> 00:27:20,910
Dreams flushed down the drain

374
00:27:20,910 --> 00:27:23,910
Those looking down on you — just wait

375
