378
00:27:30,030 --> 00:27:32,270
Throw away the sour grapes, the shadow of the past

379
00:27:32,270 --> 00:27:34,190
Forever — the mystery sleeps

380
00:27:34,190 --> 00:27:36,530
Someday called to heaven, up above

381
00:27:36,530 --> 00:27:38,890
This soul I'm scrawling out — like Tupac

382
00:27:38,890 --> 00:27:41,110
