Hey, forgot something, didn't we

384
00:27:43,730 --> 00:27:45,070
A movie closing in

385
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,490
Everyone's an entertainer

386
00:27:46,490 --> 00:27:48,890
Those who remember make it real

387
00:27:48,890 --> 00:27:51,070
Who's that speeding down the highway, Ventinger?

388
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:55,750
Oh, the frustration in my chest, high-speed impulse

389
00:27:55,750 --> 00:28:00,750
Oh, the mind that looks away

390
00:28:00,750 --> 00:28:04,850
Chasing dreams, laughed at, battered and gleaming — my way

391
00:28:04,850 --> 00:28:08,130
You all should know who we are

392
00:28:08,130 --> 00:28:12,690
Forever young, hey — even today

393
00:28:12,690 --> 00:28:17,550
We keep chasing dreams like the recklessness of youth

394
00:28:17,550 --> 00:28:20,130
Forever young, hey

395
00:28:20,130 --> 00:28:22,170
That's never going to change

396
00:28:22,170 --> 00:28:23,790
Come on, let's stand up

397
00:28:23,790 --> 00:28:28,510
Today, you're the youngest you'll ever be for the rest of your life

398
00:28:28,510 --> 00:28:30,990
If your resolve is half-hearted, throw it away for good

399
00:28:30,990 --> 00:28:33,070
Hey yeah

400
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:35,870
Oh, the rules have changed — laugh it all off

401
00:28:35,870 --> 00:28:37,150
Be proud, better days

402
00:28:37,150 --> 00:28:38,370
It's not over yet

403
00:28:38,370 --> 00:28:39,410
I won't let it end

404
00:28:39,410 --> 00:28:40,450
Until I burn out

405
00:28:40,450 --> 00:28:41,870
Forever

406
00:28:41,870 --> 00:28:43,070
It's not over yet

