00:28:43,070 --> 00:28:44,210
I won't let it end

408
00:28:44,210 --> 00:28:45,170
Until I drop dead

409
00:28:45,170 --> 00:28:47,410
Forever

410
00:28:47,410 --> 00:28:52,670
Forever Young, still chasing dreams

411
00:28:52,670 --> 00:28:57,570
A heart that's serious won't take orders from anyone

412
00:28:57,570 --> 00:29:04,430
Forever Young, if you can't escape those feelings

413
00:29:04,430 --> 00:29:08,230
Then just face them head-on

414
00:29:08,230 --> 00:29:11,170
I won't let it end, until I burn out

415
00:29:11,170 --> 00:29:13,810
It's not over yet

416
00:29:13,810 --> 00:29:15,890
I won't let it end, until I drop dead

417
00:29:15,890 --> 00:29:19,710
It's not over yet

418
00:29:19,710 --> 00:29:22,050
Forever Young

419
00:29:22,050 --> 00:29:24,190
Yes, today

420
00:29:24,190 --> 00:29:27,770
Is the youngest day you have left in your life

421
00:29:27,770 --> 00:29:34,170
Marine, thank you for listening!

422
00:29:39,870 --> 00:29:40,950
Thank you for listening!

423
00:29:40,950 --> 00:29:42,250
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

424
00:29:42,250 --> 00:29:43,110
Wooo!

425
00:29:43,110 --> 00:29:45,690
Like, I really wanted to sing "Forever Young"

426
00:29:45,690 --> 00:29:47,190
Together with Marine!

427
00:29:47,190 --> 00:29:48,890
That song, "Forever Young"

428
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:49,060
Ahh~

429
00:29:49,060 --> 00:29:52,050
So we don't become old ladies!

430
00:29:52,050 --> 00:29:52,710
Come on now—

431
00:29:52,710 --> 00:29:54,210
We were forever young!

432
00:29:54,210 --> 00:29:54,930
That's what I'd say!

433
00:29:54,930 --> 00:29:56,410
Come on!

434
00:29:56,410 --> 00:29:57,410
You young folks too—

435
00:29:57,410 --> 00:29:57,870
Ahh~

436
00:29:57,870 --> 00:29:59,810
Everyone, everyone is forever young!

437
00:29:59,810 --> 00:30:01,610
Everyone's young, everyone's young!

438
00:30:01,610 --> 00:30:03,610
Marine, today— today—

439
00:30:03,610 --> 00:30:05,390
Look behind you!

440
00:30:05,390 --> 00:30:07,210
They performed for us!

441
00:30:07,210 --> 00:30:15,360
Huh, like just one person?

442
00:30:15,360 --> 00:30:17,360
No no, you can pick two! Pick two!

443
00:30:17,360 --> 00:30:21,100
Aww, poor thing

444
00:30:21,100 --> 00:30:23,100
The Koronesuki are like—

445
00:30:23,100 --> 00:30:30,200
Go ahead!

446
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:32,000
Wait, show them— the back!

447
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:34,000
Everyone's looking down!

448
00:30:34,500 --> 00:30:39,540
Ahahahaha! Haha! Hosoinu~!

449
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:49,800
Ahahaha! Cute! Cute! Cute! Cute! Cute! Cute! Cute! Cute! So cute! Hosoinu! Come here, Marine! Come here!

450
00:30:49,800 --> 00:30:56,020
Yes, it's Hosoinu! Is Hosoinu on guitar? Guitar? Hosoinu-chan!

451
00:30:55,810 --> 00:30:57,610
Your tongue color is so cute!

452
00:30:57,610 --> 00:30:58,450
It's all dried out~

453
00:30:58,450 --> 00:31:00,210
The tongue's sticking out because it's dry, but the color of the tongue—

454
00:31:00,210 --> 00:31:01,210
Oh, it's dry, isn't it

455
00:31:01,210 --> 00:31:03,210
Yeah, dried out and no sweetness, huh

456
00:31:04,010 --> 00:31:05,010
Sorry for gathering so many of you!

457
00:31:05,010 --> 00:31:05,810
Okay, who's next?

458
00:31:05,810 --> 00:31:06,810
So cute

459
00:31:06,810 --> 00:31:07,810
One more, one more!

460
00:31:07,810 --> 00:31:08,700
Okay then—

461
00:31:08,700 --> 00:31:09,610
Futoinu?

462
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:10,610
Futoinu!

463
00:31:10,610 --> 00:31:11,770
It's Futoinu!

464
00:31:11,770 --> 00:31:15,140
Yes!

465
00:31:15,140 --> 00:31:16,140
Big!

466
00:31:16,140 --> 00:31:17,140
Big, isn't it!

467
00:31:17,140 --> 00:31:19,010
So cute!

468
00:31:20,010 --> 00:31:21,010
The tongue color is a little brighter

469
00:31:21,010 --> 00:31:22,010
Cute!

470
00:31:22,810 --> 00:31:23,810
More than Hosoinu's

471
00:31:24,610 --> 00:31:25,610
Did you get a photo? Everyone get one?

472
00:31:25,610 --> 00:31:26,410
Did you get it?

473
00:31:26,410 --> 00:31:27,410
Cute!

474
00:31:31,010 --> 00:31:32,490
Let's take one with both of them too! Both!

475
00:31:32,490 --> 00:31:33,830
Oh right, let's take one with both! Both!

476
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:37,780
Stand around here

477
00:31:44,180 --> 00:31:51,170
Koronesuki, do you love Koro-san?

478
00:31:51,170 --> 00:31:51,570
Do you love her?

479
00:31:51,570 --> 00:31:52,770
Do you love Koro-san?

480
00:31:52,770 --> 00:31:55,480
Oh good!

481
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,700
Let me join in

482
00:31:56,700 --> 00:31:57,260
Why though?

483
00:31:57,260 --> 00:31:58,460
You're a Koronesuki!

484
00:31:58,460 --> 00:32:00,980
How does it feel standing next to Koro-san?

485
00:32:00,980 --> 00:32:04,240
Are you happy? With Marine right next to you?

486
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,060
Not happy?

487
00:32:05,060 --> 00:32:06,300
Deep down you like it, don't you?

488
00:32:06,300 --> 00:32:08,020
Hey, cut it out!

489
00:32:08,020 --> 00:32:09,340
No, no, that's enough, I'm leaving!

490
00:32:09,340 --> 00:32:10,560
I'm going home, seriously

491
00:32:10,560 --> 00:32:11,140
Alright, let's go

492
00:32:11,140 --> 00:32:13,860
So today we had this band with us

493
00:32:13,860 --> 00:32:15,580
Hey, I want to take one last photo with Marine too

494
00:32:15,580 --> 00:32:16,420
Let's do it, let's do it!

495
00:32:16,420 --> 00:32:19,080
Since today is Forever Young after all

496
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,120
Hey, Marine, the mic

497
00:32:21,180 --> 00:32:22,340
Here, hold the mic

498
00:32:22,340 --> 00:32:25,540
Oh wait, I've got the wrong mic

499
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:27,260
The mic, yeah, it's fine, it's fine

500
00:32:27,260 --> 00:32:29,340
Just speak up loud and it'll pick you up

501
00:32:29,340 --> 00:32:32,310
Like this, see

502
00:32:32,310 --> 00:32:33,210
Does it look good?

503
00:32:33,210 --> 00:32:34,570
Nice and bold

504
00:32:34,570 --> 00:32:36,450
I put it right in the center

505
00:32:36,450 --> 00:32:37,810
Got a nice smiling shot!

506
00:32:37,810 --> 00:32:39,160
Thank you, Marine

507
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:39,900
Thank you

508
00:32:39,900 --> 00:32:41,500
Alright, I've got the next song coming up so I'll head off

509
00:32:41,500 --> 00:32:43,240
Can you handle the costume change on your own?

510
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,740
Oh, wait, really? Like that?

511
00:32:44,740 --> 00:32:45,840
It's fine, it's fine, it's fine

512
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:47,900
Alright, I'll leave the band roster to you

513
00:32:47,900 --> 00:32:48,700
Huh?

514
00:32:48,700 --> 00:32:49,740
Okay, bye-bye, bye-bye!

515
00:32:49,740 --> 00:32:53,140
Wait, what do you mean "leave it to me"...

516
00:32:53,140 --> 00:32:55,760
What kind of mood is this — oh, um, sorry

517
00:32:55,760 --> 00:32:58,960
Oh, everyone — and everyone, for the next song—

518
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,440
Phew!

519
00:33:01,740 --> 00:33:05,870
La-da-da-oh~

520
00:33:05,870 --> 00:33:13,380
How to make excuses and all that

521
00:33:13,180 --> 00:33:18,620
I've finally started to learn it, to make it mine — a flexible mind

522
00:33:18,620 --> 00:33:24,300
How to carry the past, how to keep the rhythm, how to settle things, how to write what I love

523
00:33:24,300 --> 00:33:29,880
Rode the wave, gave it a try — a body that won't take the easy way

524
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:35,280
How to be hated, how to be adored, how to hold on, how to clash with grace

525
00:33:35,280 --> 00:33:40,740
There's still so much more I want to learn — a mountain of it — nothing but room to grow

526
00:33:40,740 --> 00:33:43,480
Woof woof woof — nothing but room to grow

527
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:46,300
Woof woof woof — nothing but room to grow

528
00:33:46,300 --> 00:33:49,020
